# ---- Never commit game data ------------------------------------------
# ROM images, in any wrapper. The JP dump in this folder is named .md (Mega Drive),
# so that extension is excluded here too - keep Markdown in docs/ and work/ as *.markdown
# is not used; the README is whitelisted below.
*.bin
*.gen
*.smd
*.SMD
*.md
!README.md
!docs/*.md
!work/*.md
*.bps
*.ips
PSIII_Disasm/ps3original.bin
PSIII_Disasm/ps3built.bin
PSIII_Disasm/ps3built.prev.bin

# Generated tables the assembler includes are kept (they are small and the
# build compares them against a fresh generation).
!PSIII_Disasm/vwf/*.bin

# Emulator savestates and memory dumps contain the game's RAM/VRAM.
*.state
*.exs
work/state/
work/analysis/*.png

# ---- Third-party binaries: link to them, do not vendor them ------------
blastem-win32-*/
flips/
Exodus_*/

# ---- Build products ---------------------------------------------------
PSIII_Disasm/ps3.p
PSIII_Disasm/ps3.h
PSIII_Disasm/ps3.log
*.lst
release/PS3_Retranslation_v*/
release/*.zip

# ---- Editor and interpreter litter ------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.claude/
